* ===========================================================================
* #39: DUMMY-RATIO x SOURCE-IMPEDANCE SWEEP
* ===========================================================================
* The tg4dum branches above fix TWO things at once: the textbook rd = 1:2
* dummy-to-main width ratio, and DR-0001's contracted worst-case 500 ohm
* source impedance. Those two are not independent -- the dummy cancels the
* fraction of the main device's channel charge that lands on the HOLD node,
* and that fraction is set by how the charge divides between the hold cap
* and the source at the turn-off edge, i.e. by Rs. These branches separate
* the two axes so #39 can tell a mis-sized dummy from a drive-condition
* dependency:
*
*   rd swept at the contracted Rs = 500 ohm : tg4dum (0.50), d70, d85
*   Rs swept at the as-drawn rd = 0.50      : s10, s20, s30, s50, s150,
*                                             tg4dum (500 ohm)
*
* Main-device geometry is 40u/80u throughout -- the DR-0007 switch. Only the
* dummy width and the source resistor change, so every number here is
* directly comparable to the tg4dum column.

* ---- s20: rd=1:2 dummy, Rs = 20 ohm -- candidate compliant drive condition ----
Rs_s20_f00 nin_f00 ni_s20_f00 20
Xsw_s20_f00 ni_s20_f00 no_s20_f00 nclk nclkb vdd tgate_dum wn=40u wp=80u rd=0.5
XCl_s20_f00 no_s20_f00 0 mim_cap_2f0 c_width=66.36u c_length=66.36u
Rs_s20_f25 nin_f25 ni_s20_f25 20
Xsw_s20_f25 ni_s20_f25 no_s20_f25 nclk nclkb vdd tgate_dum wn=40u wp=80u rd=0.5
XCl_s20_f25 no_s20_f25 0 mim_cap_2f0 c_width=66.36u c_length=66.36u
Rs_s20_f50 nin_f50 ni_s20_f50 20
Xsw_s20_f50 ni_s20_f50 no_s20_f50 nclk nclkb vdd tgate_dum wn=40u wp=80u rd=0.5
XCl_s20_f50 no_s20_f50 0 mim_cap_2f0 c_width=66.36u c_length=66.36u
Rs_s20_f75 nin_f75 ni_s20_f75 20
Xsw_s20_f75 ni_s20_f75 no_s20_f75 nclk nclkb vdd tgate_dum wn=40u wp=80u rd=0.5
XCl_s20_f75 no_s20_f75 0 mim_cap_2f0 c_width=66.36u c_length=66.36u
Rs_s20_f100 nin_f100 ni_s20_f100 20
Xsw_s20_f100 ni_s20_f100 no_s20_f100 nclk nclkb vdd tgate_dum wn=40u wp=80u rd=0.5
XCl_s20_f100 no_s20_f100 0 mim_cap_2f0 c_width=66.36u c_length=66.36u

* ---- s10: rd=1:2 dummy, Rs = 10 ohm -- near-ideal (hard) source ----
Rs_s10_f00 nin_f00 ni_s10_f00 10
Xsw_s10_f00 ni_s10_f00 no_s10_f00 nclk nclkb vdd tgate_dum wn=40u wp=80u rd=0.5
XCl_s10_f00 no_s10_f00 0 mim_cap_2f0 c_width=66.36u c_length=66.36u
Rs_s10_f100 nin_f100 ni_s10_f100 10
Xsw_s10_f100 ni_s10_f100 no_s10_f100 nclk nclkb vdd tgate_dum wn=40u wp=80u rd=0.5
XCl_s10_f100 no_s10_f100 0 mim_cap_2f0 c_width=66.36u c_length=66.36u

* ---- s30: rd=1:2 dummy, Rs = 30 ohm ----
Rs_s30_f00 nin_f00 ni_s30_f00 30
