* ===== worst-case acquisition branches ===============================
* (the bs20_step companion branch is DISABLED along with bs10/bs20 above)
Rs_tg1_step nin_step ni_tg1_step 500
Xsw_tg1_step ni_tg1_step no_tg1_step nclk nclkb vdd tgate wn=10u wp=20u
XCl_tg1_step no_tg1_step 0 mim_cap_2f0 c_width=66.36u c_length=66.36u

* The same worst-case full-scale step through the CANDIDATE DRIVE NETWORK
* (25 ohm + 1 nF at the pin, rd = 7/16). This is the branch that shows the
* external shunt capacitor does not cost acquisition: the pin now has to
* recover BOTH the source's own step and the 8.83 pF hold cap's charge-
* redistribution kick (C_hold/(C_hold+C_ext) x FS = 28.9 mV at 3.3 V FS)
* inside the same 300 ns track window, through 25 ohm x 1.009 nF = 25 ns,
* i.e. ~12 tau. Measured, not asserted. -----------------------------------
Rs_cxopt_step nin_step ni_cxopt_step 25
Cx_cxopt_step ni_cxopt_step 0 1n
Xsw_cxopt_step ni_cxopt_step no_cxopt_step nclk nclkb vdd tgate_dum wn=40u wp=80u rd=0.4375
XCl_cxopt_step no_cxopt_step 0 mim_cap_2f0 c_width=66.36u c_length=66.36u
